dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-r0/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]tmux_agent configuration section[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]config[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config: add the `tmux_agent` config block, JSON schema entry, shipped [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]defaults, and typed getters.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Interactive-CLI provider descriptor[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]descriptor[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]descriptor: add the `llm_interactive_cli` hook plus vendor metadata, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]implement it on every built-in provider, and expose it through the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry payload.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Catalog, launch-spec, and window-name resolution[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]catalog[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config, descriptor[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]catalog: build the `sase.tmux_agent` package core — entry model, catalog[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]builder, deterministic shortcut keys, launch-spec resolution, and window[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]naming — as pure, injectable functions.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]tmux window launch, renumber, and menu rendering[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]launcher[dim] · [dim][/dim]after catalog[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]launcher: add the tmux command primitives that create the agent window, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]register the exit-cleanup waiter, renumber agent windows, and render the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]styled `display-menu`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase tmux-agent command[/bold #D7AFFF]                                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after launcher[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: register and dispatch the `sase tmux-agent` command with its menu, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]direct-launch, list, dry-run, JSON, and internal renumber paths.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Catalog cache for menu latency[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cache[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cache: add the fingerprinted on-disk catalog cache and `-r/--refresh` so[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the tmux key binding renders in well under a quarter second.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Launch Control `t` and the tmux Agent panel[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ace[dim] · [dim][/dim]after launcher[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace: bind `t` in Launch Control and add the tmux Agent modal, its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]styles, footer/help wiring, and behavior tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Parity guarantee, visual snapshot, and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ace, cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]polish: pin command parity with the shell script this feature replaces, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add the PNG snapshot, and write the ACE, CLI, configuration, and plugin [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documentation.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-r0","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"g